#
# DODECAHEDRON: dodecahedron: 40 refreshes checked, {{[0-9]+}} right after a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a pruning; cutoff 0.8 nm: 0 pairs without an entry; 0 pairs listed twice, 0 in a wrong segment, 0 excluded, 0 places of a wrong order
# WIDE: dodecahedron: 2 refreshes checked, {{.*}} cutoff 1.2 nm: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} pairs without an entry
# OPC: dipeptide-opc: 60 refreshes checked, {{[0-9]+}} right after a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a pruning; cutoff 0.8 nm: 0 pairs without an entry; 0 pairs listed twice, 0 in a wrong segment, 0 excluded, 0 places of a wrong order
# TIP3P: dipeptide-tip3p: 60 refreshes checked, {{[0-9]+}} right after a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a pruning; cutoff 0.8 nm: 0 pairs without an entry; 0 pairs listed twice, 0 in a wrong segment, 0 excluded, 0 places of a wrong order
# MIXTURE: mixture: 30 refreshes checked, {{[0-9]+}} right after a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a pruning; cutoff 0.8 nm: 0 pairs without an entry; 0 pairs listed twice, 0 in a wrong segment, 0 excluded, 0 places of a wrong order
# IMAGES: dodecahedron: 30 refreshes checked, {{[0-9]+}} right after a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a build, {{[1-9][0-9]*}} just before a pruning; cutoff 0.6 nm: 0 pairs without an entry; 0 pairs listed twice, 0 in a wrong segment, 0 excluded, 0 places of a wrong order
# GROWTH: growth: 2 refreshes checked, 2 right after a build, 0 just before a build, 0 just before a pruning; cutoff 0.8 nm: 0 pairs without an entry; 0 pairs listed twice, 0 in a wrong segment, 0 excluded, 0 places of a wrong order
